# Gate lock for a workspace operation on .beads itself. It has to be ignored
# from here: bd writes gate files beside the root they guard, so guarding
# .beads puts this one alongside the directory rather than inside it, out of
# reach of .beads/.gitignore.
/.beads.gate.lock
